如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_PLENTY_OF_PARKING"],"很多停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3YcHCLgBKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3IcHCLcBKAg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_FREE_STREET_PARKING"],"免費路邊停車",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3YcHCLoBKAA"],[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_STREET_PARKING"],"付費路邊停車",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3YcHCLsBKAE"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3IcHCLkBKAk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3YcHCL0BKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwils5-A99mWAxVKHjQIHYdmJkEQ3IcHCLwBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["相較於其他拉麵店，一尾拉麵走的是親民、大份量、高CP值的路線\n\n湯頭部分主要以豚骨為基底，整體風味調整得較為順口、不油膩，對一般人或拉麵初心者來說非常友善，若要調整為濃口也可以勾選，老闆也會很貼心提醒口味部分；配料方面基本都包含叉燒、溏心蛋、筍干、高麗菜\n\n一尾豚骨拉麵：\n最受歡迎的招牌，配料誠意十足，因為添加了高麗菜，這在傳統日式拉麵中較為少見，但也因此為濃郁的豚骨湯頭增添了清甜感，吃起來不易膩口。\n秘製蒜味噌拉麵：\n推薦給喜歡重口味的人，蒜香與味噌融合得恰到話處，湯頭更顯濃厚。\n甘味人生拉麵：\n湯底為非常清甜的醬油底，應該有使用許多蔬果熬煮的，帶有獨特甘甜層次的口味。\n\n喜歡吃肉的朋友也可以勾選「肉花版」，滿滿一圈叉燒肉看了也非常療癒\n此外供應免費加麵一球，一樣可以客製化正常、硬、生麵\n\n整體價位約在220–300元之間，不收服務費，對比現在許多動輒 300 元起跳且份量精緻的拉麵店，這裡的 CP 值極高\n\n最後建議各位到來的客人請把拉麵吃到見底，不要問我為什麼😂",null,[0,30]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11832649143266428801/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRzZG1Ock5WTk9WamxRV2pOd2NsZ3dlR3RPTUhCUVlsZFpOVnBJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11